[[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585151\">Op. 7040H80 REAR PARCEL SHELF - R.R.</a></p><p>1. Remove the plastic protection for the rear speaker.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003377.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and disconnect the electrical connector for the speaker (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Rear left loudspeaker (in parcel shelf)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005387\">See P030 LEFT REAR SPEAKER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Right rear speaker (in parcel shelf)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005391\">See P031 RIGHT REAR SPEAKER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the mounting.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003378.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>Carry out the same operations for the remaining support.</p>"],[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the electrical connector for the speaker.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Rear left loudspeaker (in parcel shelf)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005387\">See P030 LEFT REAR SPEAKER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Right rear speaker (in parcel shelf)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223005391\">See P031 RIGHT REAR SPEAKER</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the support and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Fit the protection for the speaker.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585151\">Op. 7040H80 REAR PARCEL SHELF - R.R.</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]